{"type":"message","id":"7fad38d9","parentId":"0bf65825","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:23:02.787Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All fixes are tested and working. Let me provide a summary of what was done.","thinkingSignature":"7fda4d0d21c54dc7a0f0a1418008adf8fcb65b67cb1d5285206c67ba9cacb1fa"},{"type":"text","text":"All fixes implemented and tested. Here's a summary:\n\n## 修复完成\n\n### 🔴 高优先级修复:\n1. **ValueError 捕获** - `cmd_update` 中 `pipeline.index()` 现在用 try-except 捕获\n2. **线性模式重置安全访问** - `cmd_reset` 中使用 `data.get(\"pipeline\", [])` 避免直接访问\n3. **stages 存在性检查** - 新增 `ensure_stages_exist()` 函数，在所有访问 stages 的地方调用\n4. **文件锁** - `save_project()` 现在使用 `fcntl.flock` 实现文件锁\n\n### 🟡 中优先级修复:\n5. **_all_debaters_responded 检查空值** - 现在同时检查 key 存在和 value 非空\n6. **路径遍历检查** - `task_file()` 拒绝 `../`, `/`, `\\` 等危险字符\n7. **空项目处理** - 空 pipeline 会报错退出\n8. **损坏 JSON 捕获** - `load_project()` 现在捕获 `JSONDecodeError`\n\n### 🟡 低优先级修复:\n9. **日志/输出增长限制** - 新增 `truncate_logs()` 和 `truncate_output()` 函数\n10. **cross-review 重复创建防护** - 已完成的 cross-review 轮次无法重新创建\n\n测试验证: 路径遍历测试 ✅, JSON损坏测试 ✅, cross-review防重复测试 ✅"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":48679,"output":319,"cacheRead":9121,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58119,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772115771486}}
